# The repo root is a build context for three images now — webui-fastify,
# logservice-fiber, and the two legacy ones — and without this file every one of
# them uploads node_modules and the whole git history before doing anything.
#
# Keep this conservative: a path excluded here that a Dockerfile needs fails as
# "file not found" at COPY time, which is a clear error, but only at build time.
.git/
.github/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/dist/

# Generated or local-only.
certs/generated/
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Documentation sites and plans: large, and nothing in an image reads them.
docs/
plans/
notes/

# Test output and scratch.
coverage/
**/.DS_Store
